  f32 pairs   cost 20.625  error <= 1.776e-14 (5 u^2) relative: as f32 within 0.5 + 2.98e-07 ulp
  required: the result feeds an f32: within 0.5 + 2^-10 ulp of the exact value (ten guard bits; `ulp X`, `tol R` or `atol T` to change)
  -> f32 pairs: cost 20.625 against 110.125 (-81.3%), 20 f32 operations for 8
  the form:
    t1 = x * y                               !
    t2 = z * z                               !
    t3 = -t1
    t4 = fma(x, y, t3)                       !
    t5 = -t2
    t6 = fma(z, z, t5)                       !
    t7 = t1 - t2
    t8 = t4 - t6
    t9 = t7 + t8
    t10 = t9 < 0
    t11 = t10 ? t1 : t2
    t12 = t10 ? t4 : t6
    t13 = t11 + x                            !
    t14 = t13 - x                            !
    t15 = t13 - t14                          !
    t16 = t11 - t14                          !
    t17 = x - t15                            !
    t18 = t16 + t17                          !
    t19 = t12 + t18
    t20 = t13 + t19                          !
    result: t20
